From 90c82d7ef03aad6313b1e2e7a0efaeed86050117 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:06:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(wire-edm): sew healed rulings by input preimage

Preserve input arc positions across removed offset spans.
Use surviving offset support normals at healed corners.
Pin fan rulings and retain the existing surface safety checks.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2694
